              "text": "However, the event changed his life forever, and he had to live with the heavy folds.",
              "audioStart": 125.713,
              "audioEnd": 130.312
            },
            {
              "text": "The man who built the place on the island never saw the animal again after that morning.",
              "audioStart": 131.175,
              "audioEnd": 135.512
            },
            {
              "text": "He returned to his ship and sailed away across the blue sea.",
