              "audioEnd": 163.7
            },
            {
              "text": "They learn that taking food without asking can lead to very surprising results in life.",
              "audioStart": 164.562,
              "audioEnd": 169.162
            },
            {
              "text": "And so the story continues to be shared from one generation to the next across the world.",
