              "audioEnd": 210.275
            },
            {
              "text": "The memory of the event remained alive in the minds of everyone who visited the region.",
              "audioStart": 211.137,
              "audioEnd": 215.225
            },
            {
              "text": "Children grew up hearing about the silly animal that could not control his appetite.",
              "audioStart": 216.088,
              "audioEnd": 220.05
            },
            {
              "text": "They learned that taking things without permission would always bring trouble in the end.",
